{
	"name": "Redirected Power",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/light/beam-impact-deflect-teal.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 7th level, your defensive use of magics improves to the point that you may foil a foe’s intentions. When a spell or magic effect targets a creature or object within your threatened area, you may use your reaction and spend 1 exertion to try and redirect the power to another valid target within your threatened area. To do so, make an Arcana check using your spellcasting ability against a DC of 12 plus the spell’s level. On a success, you can choose a new target, or targets, for the spell.</p>",
